---
import StandardPageLayout from "../layouts/StandardPageLayout.astro";
const pageTitle = "About Me";
---
<StandardPageLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
    <p>
        I'm a <strong>game designer</strong> currently working on the <i>Call of Duty: Black Ops</i> series of video games as well as an indie stealth-action game.
        <br/><br/>
        I'm obsessed with discovering truth in design, and making the best entertainment possible, which my multidisciplinary background in science and art has aided me in pursuing.
        <br/><br/>
        I currently reside in Los Angeles, California.
    </p>
    <h2 class="title is-4">Publication</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>
            Oliver, Jakob Arndt, Parwesh Rallapalli, Hodger Blume (2019). “Portable Implementations for High-End Hardware Platforms”,<br />
            Big Data Analytics in Cyber-Physical Systems: Machine Learning for the Internet of Things. Elsevier.
        </li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="title is-4">Education</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><i>M.S. Computer Science</i> from University of Southern California (May 2022)</li>
        <li><i>B.S.E. Computer Engineering</i> from Michigan State University (Dec 2019)</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="title is-4">Certifications</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><i>Deep Learning for Computer Vision</i> from NVIDIA Deep Learning Institute (May 2019)</li>
        <li><i>Machine Learning</i> from Stanford University (Dec 2017)</li>
    </ul>
</StandardPageLayout>

<style>
    body {
        background-color: rgb(186, 235, 186);
        color: black;
    }

    .title {
        color: rgb(84, 77, 187);
    }
</style>